{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b4c2d0c5-3572-8fdd-acb3-fe664a7ffb54",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:09:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosa Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Owen. Yeah, my name's Rosa Figueroa. I'm calling about a dog. My neighbor's dog keeps getting loose, and I'm kind of nervous about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me make sure I have this right. A neighbor's dog is getting out of its yard. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Out of the yard, down the street, all over. It happened twice just since the nor'easter, last weekend, Saturday into Sunday. I think the snow knocked something down by the gate, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And has the dog bothered anybody, or bitten anyone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody's been bit. But there's a lot of kids around here. They wait for the bus right at the corner, and they go up and down the sidewalk on their scooters. It's a big dog. I just keep thinking, what if one of them runs and the dog chases them? I'd feel awful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. That's a reasonable worry. Animal control would be the right place for that. Do you know if the dog is licensed, or who owns it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know about a license. I know the people, but I'm renting, I don't want a fight with them. Can I stay anonymous?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take your report and note that you'd prefer not to be named. I'll need to take down a callback number in case the officer has questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0169. Sorry, I'm on my cell, I'm standing in the parking lot at the, um, warehouse club. I'm trying to decide if a membership is worth it, honestly. Is it okay if I'm out here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear you well. Let me read that number back. 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll pass this to animal control today, and an officer should reach out to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you, Owen. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
